Text: In this paper, we present a new domain adaptation tech- nique for slot tagging inspired by recent advances in zero- shot learning. Traditionally, slot tagging is formulated as a sequence labeling task using the BIO representation (Fig- ure 1a). Our approach formulates this problem as detecting spans that contain values for each slot as shown in Figure 1b.

